{"t":"The Way of the Monk Quest/Spoiler","s":"the-way-of-the-monk-quest-spoiler-05c5b","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Tome_of_Knowledge_2cf731.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">The Way of the Monk Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Monk Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Way of the Monk Quest</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">275<br/>no requirement for starting, increases with each mission</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15.00.249ccc<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">April 08, 2025<br/>Monk Vocation Update</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>Follow the path of ancient Merudri to gain wisdom and skills worthy of true monk.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Valley\">Blue Valley</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Targuna\">Targuna</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Tyrsung\">Tyrsung</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'dendriel</a>, Maze of the Lost Souls, <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Pits%20of%20Inferno\">Pits of Inferno</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Corruption%20Hole\">Corruption Hole</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Kilmaresh\">Kilmaresh</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>many\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>10 Promotion Points and the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Hope%20of%20the%20Merudri\">Hope of the Merudri</a> for all <a href=\"#/wiki/Vocation\">vocations</a>. It will also reward 847.8k Experience Points in total, once all 10 Shrines have been touched. For <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk\">Monks</a>, it also rewards auto attack damage increase of 25% (or 50% when <a href=\"#/wiki/Serene\">Serene</a>), as well as the <a href=\"#/wiki/Forceful%20Uppercut\">Forceful Uppercut</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Mystic%20Repulse\">Mystic Repulse</a> spells.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Requirements\">Requirements</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Level 275 is required for full completion.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a>; or <a href=\"#/wiki/Secret%20Agent%20Tools\">Secret Agent Tools</a> with similar functionalities.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">Levitate</a> spell, or parcels.</li>\n<li>Started the <b>Nibelor 2: Ecological Terrorism</b> mission of <a href=\"#/quest/the-ice-islands-quest\">The Ice Islands Quest</a> (for access to <a href=\"#/wiki/Tyrsung\">Tyrsung</a>).</li>\n<li>Reached the <b>The Levers</b> mission of <a href=\"#/quest/the-pits-of-inferno-quest\">The Pits of Inferno Quest</a> (requires all five vocations, or players with a high health pool to cross the purple flames).</li>\n<li>Completed <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>Handed in eight <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tome%20of%20Knowledge\"><img alt=\"Tome of Knowledge\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tome_of_Knowledge_2cf731.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Tome%20of%20Knowledge\">Tome of Knowledges</a> to NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a> (access to <a href=\"#/wiki/Corruption%20Hole\">Corruption Hole</a>; see <a href=\"#/quest/tomes-of-knowledge-quest\">Tomes of Knowledge Quest</a>).</li>\n<li>Reached the <b>The Powerful Relic</b> stage of the Barkless mission in the <a href=\"#/quest/cults-of-tibia-quest\">Cults of Tibia Quest</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Three-Fold_Path\">The Three-Fold Path</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Blue_Valley\">Blue Valley</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i><b>Note:</b> If you are playing any vocation other than <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk\">Monk</a>, begin the quest from this section.</i></dd></dl>\n<p>Meet <a href=\"#/wiki/Enpa-Deia%20Pema\">Enpa-Deia Pema</a> in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Valley\">Blue Valley</a> and ask him about <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">pilgrimage</span>. You can reach the <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Valley\">Blue Valley</a> via the <a href=\"#/wiki/Adventurers%27%20Guild\">Adventurer's Guild</a>. On the upper floor, next to the Reward Shrine, you will find an <a href=\"#/wiki/Enchanted%20Guarded%20Crystal%20Sphere\">Enchanted Guarded Crystal Sphere</a>. Use it to be teleported to the island.\n</p><p>He will explain that all are welcome to visit the ancient Merudri shrines, though the journey is arduous and requires endurance. Use one of the nearby <a href=\"#/wiki/Guarded%20Crystal%20Sphere\">Guarded Crystal Spheres</a> to begin your pilgrimage.  \n</p><p>The shrines are scattered across different locations and **must be visited in the correct order**, from lowest to highest level. Skipping a shrine will prevent you from progressing further. Each shrine has a minimum level requirement, grants rewards, and offers additional unique rewards to <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk\">Monks</a>.  \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\"><b>Shrine #</b>\n</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\"><b>Shrine</b>\n</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\"><b>Level</b>\n</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\"><b>Location</b>\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><b>Reward</b>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Monk only\n</th>\n<th>Other vocations\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>Guidance\n</td>\n<td>6\n</td>\n<td><center><div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-2\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 153px; height: 153px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -1705px;left:-297px;clip:rect(1705px 450px 1858px 297px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"4096\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\" width=\"5120\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:153px;width:76px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:76px;width:153px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31931,31867,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (31931, 31867, 7)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div